@startuml
title Subfigure: #24 DAG 错误主路径时序

participant file_read as FR
participant cond_skip as CS
participant elseBlock as EB
participant thenBlock as TB
database "$r_err" as ERR

FR -> ERR : set(ENOENT, ...)
note right of ERR : OperationError 结构

CS -> ERR : read $r_err
ERR --> CS : truthy (non-empty obj)
CS -> CS : pop self
CS -> EB : pop elseBlock (n=2)
CS -> EB : pop skipN (n=2)

note over TB : stack 剩 [thenBlock]
TB -> TB : 执行 then_block

@enduml
